== Effects ==
* Firing without a pause for {{dlc|nr+}} 7.5 seconds / {{dlc|r+}} 4 seconds creates a small brown cloud that damages enemies who walk through it.
** {{dlc|nr+}} The damage is equal to Isaac's base tear damage, dealt roughly 5 times per second.
*** The clouds last for 15 seconds, meaning a maximum of two can be active at any given time.
** {{dlc|r+}} The damage starts equal to Isaac's tear damage, dealt roughly 5 times per second. The damage will gradually decrease, while the cloud gradually increases in area size.
*** Each cloud lasts for 10 seconds; the damage decreases to around 43% for the duration of the cloud.
** The clouds can be moved by shooting them.
** Changing firing direction is allowed, but any pause in holding a fire button or taking damage resets the timer.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r+}} The visual size of the cloud is not accurate, as the actual hitbox is much bigger than how it appears.

== Synergies ==
* {{T|Gigante Bean}}: The clouds will be larger, increasing the range drastically. The damage is unaffected.

